--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7a9ff481f6c708747b6a9617fff92311, type: 3}
  m_Name: PostDia
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: Hirose
    portrait: {fileID: 2378355503943272512, guid: d5c8eb7167e897d45b7fce5da898e35a, type: 3}
    text: I appreciate your help for earlier, even if I didn't need it. What are
      you trying to achieve?
    typingSpeed: 0.1
    autoAdvance: 0
    autoAdvanceDelay: 0
  - speakerName: Edward
    portrait: {fileID: -996614095021860825, guid: fef7ca89a6483c149870e7045b110c5b, type: 3}
    text: I fell down to this place around 15 minutes ago, my goal is to escape from
      here.
    typingSpeed: 0.1
    autoAdvance: 0
    autoAdvanceDelay: 0
  - speakerName: Edward
    portrait: {fileID: -996614095021860825, guid: fef7ca89a6483c149870e7045b110c5b, type: 3}
    text: The only place going forward seems to be up the stairs... so I just kept
      following it. If I want to make it out of here I will need some help.
    typingSpeed: 0.1
    autoAdvance: 0
    autoAdvanceDelay: 0
  - speakerName: Hirose
    portrait: {fileID: 2378355503943272512, guid: d5c8eb7167e897d45b7fce5da898e35a, type: 3}
    text: Those were my exact thoughts too. My name is Hirose by the way.
    typingSpeed: 0.1
    autoAdvance: 0
    autoAdvanceDelay: 0
  - speakerName: Hirose
    portrait: {fileID: 2378355503943272512, guid: d5c8eb7167e897d45b7fce5da898e35a, type: 3}
    text: Since we're both humans and we also coincidentally share the same goal,
      I guess we can cooperate for the time being.
    typingSpeed: 0.1
    autoAdvance: 0
    autoAdvanceDelay: 0
